  "why": "The corrected card adds only the canonical CC-010 verification-report FILE scope. The integration validator now rejects the same omission for every scoped FORMAL non-overseer worker while preserving decision, overseer, planning, blocked, and exploration cards. The six implementation scopes, candidate, worker ledger, selection, program, graph, and implementation bytes remain unchanged."
